{
 "duration": 24.165,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "At noon the trail was soft slush, so Ben left his cleats in the car.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 4.432
  },
  {
   "text": "By three the sun was behind the ridge,",
   "start": 4.832,
   "end": 7.069
  },
  {
   "text": "and that slush froze into ruts of ice on the way down.",
   "start": 7.219,
   "end": 10.344
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 10.744,
   "end": 11.671
  },
  {
   "text": "In winter, plan for the trail you'll walk out on.",
   "start": 11.971,
   "end": 14.512
  },
  {
   "text": "Roll your cleats into their bag and keep them in your pack.",
   "start": 14.812,
   "end": 17.702
  },
  {
   "text": "Pull them on at the first shine of ice.",
   "start": 18.002,
   "end": 19.892
  },
  {
   "text": "Ben got down steady.",
   "start": 20.392,
   "end": 21.61
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next winter hike.",
   "start": 22.11,
   "end": 23.965
  }
 ],
